sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant W as WebhookController
    participant K as Kafka (meeting.events)
    participant MC as MeetingEventConsumer
    participant MS as MeetingService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant EH as DefaultErrorHandler
    participant DLQ as Kafka (meeting.events.DLT)

    Note over C,DLQ: Edge case — meeting.ended for a session that was never started → retried, then DLQ

    C->>W: POST meeting.ended (unknown sessionId)
    W->>K: publish
    W-->>C: 202 Accepted
    K->>MC: deliver
    MC->>MS: handleMeetingEnded
    MS->>DB: findById(sessionId)
    DB-->>MS: empty
    MS-->>MC: throw UnknownSessionException (retryable)

    loop retry with exponential backoff (bounded)
        MC->>MS: reprocess
        MS->>DB: findById(sessionId)
        DB-->>MS: still empty
        MS-->>MC: throw again
    end

    MC->>EH: retries exhausted
    EH->>DLQ: publish record to meeting.events.DLT
    Note right of EH: The started event may be briefly in flight, so retry covers it.<br>A truly orphaned end is dead-lettered, never silently dropped.
